Records that must fail: each one's must-fail line names the failure class of
the first thing that must fail (see tools/corpus/runs.tck), which tools/corpus
and tackc's porttest must both find. A record that passes, or fails as another
class, fails the check. They are the reviews' probes and mutations that a record
can express, and one record for each class no probe shows.
-- class-build/main.tck --
package main

// main does not compile.
func main() {
    x := 
}
